# Overview

Reproduce the designated expert kernel as standalone native code for its backend,
without expert-library dependencies, callable from
Python through pybind11. Preserve the chosen expert instance's behavior, performance,
and implementation mechanisms. Expand its library abstractions into explicit native code;
the delivered computation must not depend on the expert library.

Repository: {{ repository | tojson }}
Expert kernel: {{ expert_kernel | tojson }}

