and workloads.jsonl, which may be empty. Fixed tensor paths are relative to that directory,
usually under inputs/. Serialized Problem JSON and inline Artifacts retain
their complete definition and workloads.
The controller stages the repository and mounts it read-only. The expert kernel
is a source path or name to locate there. Do not clone or modify the mounted source.

